[0.0, "o", "2H\u001b[1K\u001b[C- \u001b[1mBackend\u001b(B\u001b[m: Node.js/Express API server\u001b[21X\u001b[9;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[C-\u001b[1X\u001b[1m\u001b[CDatabase\u001b(B\u001b[m: SQLite (simple, no\u001b[1X\u001b[Csetup required)\u001b[12X\r\n  - \u001b[1mReceipt parsing\u001b(B\u001b[m: Claude API with vision to extract      \r\n  items,\u001b[1X\u001b[Cprices,\u001b[1X\u001b[Cand\u001b[1X\u001b[Ccategories\u001b[1X\u001b[Cfrom\u001b[1X\u001b[Creceipt\u001b[1X\u001b[Cimages\u001b[9X\r\n                                                            \u001b[13;60H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1mCore features\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  1. Upload receipt photos (drag & drop or file picker)     \r\n  2. AI-powered extraction of line items, prices, dates, and\r\n   store names \u001b[1X\u001b[C          \u001b[1X\u001b[C  \u001b[1X\u001b[C    \u001b[1X\u001b[C      \u001b[1X\u001b[C       \u001b[1X\u001b[C      \u001b[1X\u001b[C   \r\n  3. Auto-categorization of items (groceries, dining,       \r\n  electronics, etc.)    \u001b[1X\u001b[C  \u001b[1X\u001b[C     \u001b[1X\u001b[C           \u001b[1X\u001b[C       \u001b[7X\r\n  4. Dashboard with spending over time by category and item \u001b[20;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[C5. Browse past receipts and their details       \u001b[1X\u001b[C   \u001b[1X\u001b[C    \u001b[1X\r\n                                                            \r\n  \u001b[1mKey questions for yo"]
[0.0, "o", "u:\u001b(B\u001b[m                                    \r\n  1. \u001b[1mTech stack\u001b(B\u001b[m \u2014 Are you happy with React + Express +      \r\n  SQLite, or do you prefer something else (e.g., Next.js,   \r\n  Python/Flask,\u001b[1X\u001b[CPostgres)?\u001b[1X\u001b[C         \u001b[1X\u001b[C    \u001b[1X\u001b[C      \u001b[1X\u001b[C        \u001b[3X\r\n  2. \u001b[1mAuth\u001b(B\u001b[m \u2014 Should this have user accounts/login, or is a   \u001b[27;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Csingle-user local app\u001b[1X\u001b[Cfine\u001b[1X\u001b[Cfor the demo?       \u001b[1X\u001b[C  \u001b[1X\u001b[C  \u001b[1X\u001b[C \u001b[3X\r\n  3. \u001b[1mClaude API\u001b(B\u001b[m \u2014 Do you have an Anthropic API key ready for\r\n   the\u001b[1X\u001b[Creceipt\u001b[1X\u001b[Cparsing,\u001b[1X\u001b[Cor\u001b[1X\u001b[Cshould\u001b[1X\u001b[CI\u001b[1X\u001b[Cstub\u001b[1X\u001b[Cthat\u001b[1X\u001b[Cpart\u001b[1X\u001b[Cout\u001b[1X\u001b[Cfor\u001b[2X\r\n  now?                                                      \u001b[31;60H\u001b[1K\r              \r\n  Let me know and I'll get building.                        \u001b[33;60H\u001b[1K\u001b[2G\u001b[1K\u001b[C            \u001b[38;5;246m\r\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
